Priority: optional
Maintainer: Seeed Studio <techsupport@seeed.cc>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>=11~), dkms (<< 3.0.3-3~) | dh-sequence-dkms
Standards-Version: 4.6.2.1

Package: pcie-rkep-dkms
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: dkms (>= 1.95), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Rockchip pcie-rkep function driver for RKNN NPU card (DKMS)
 This package provides the source code for the host-side pcie-rkep
 PCIe EP function driver (DRV_VERSION 0x00030300, synced from the
 RK1820/RK1828 AI SDK V1.0.4) for the M.2 NPU accelerator card
 (1d87:182a), to be built with DKMS against the running kernel.
 .
 Kernel headers are required to compile the module.
